    'Bridge $100–300 in a stablecoin to {c} ($2–10 gas, 10–20 min).',
    'Supply $50–200 to {n}; keep it open 4+ weeks ($1–5 gas).',
    'Borrow $20–50 against it; repay within a week for a full cycle ($2–6 gas + interest).',
